/-
Optimization Safety Monotonicity: If optRequiredLevel O₁ ≤ optRequiredLevel O₂ and optRequiredLevel O₂ ≤ achievedLevel, then optRequiredLevel O₁ ≤ achievedLevel.
-/
structure OptimizationType where
